  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening laboratory diagnosis of TB in the region of the Americas - Americas - Multicountry Americas ORAS-CONHU (01-Nov-2020-31-Oct-2023)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multicountry Americas ORAS-CONHU, Tuberculosis, Organismo Andino de Salud - Convenio Hip&#xf3;lito Unanue (ORAS CONHU)This program has the following goals: Contribuir a mejorar la calidad del diagn&#xf3;stico de TB en las redes de laboratorio mediante el fortalecimiento de las capacidades instaladas en la regi&#xf3;n / To contribute to improving the quality of TB diagnosis through capacity strengthening of the laboratory networks in the region. The objectives of this program are: Consolidar compromisos para la sostenibilidad de los LSN y los LRN en la regi&#xf3;n / To consolidate the sustainability commitments for the SRLs and NRLs in the region.  Apoyar la adopci&#xf3;n y operacionalizaci&#xf3;n de recomendaciones internacionales de TB y el diagn&#xf3;stico de TB MDR en pol&#xed;ticas nacionales, monitorear su implementaci&#xf3;n y optimizar la utilizaci&#xf3;n de equipos de TB a nivel nacional y regional / To support the adoption and operationalization of international recommendations in relation to TB and MDR-TB in national policies, monitor their implementation and optimize the use of TB equipment at national and regional levels.  Contribuir al desarrollo, armonizaci&#xf3;n e implementaci&#xf3;n de los sistemas de informaci&#xf3;n en las redes nacionales y regionales de laboratorios de TB, con un enfoque inter-program&#xe1;tico / To contribute to the development, harmonization and implementation of information systems in national and regional TB laboratory networks, with an inter-programmatic approach</narrative>
  </description>
